                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There's a reason this game is in the hall of fame for old games it has everything. It has an endless mode , it has personality for fish , it has mechanics, it has an interesting story it has a virtual tank, and most importantly its all fun. This game was made for pure enjoyment and u will not find yourself bored, endless strategies and game modes for the same of goal of JUST MAKE MONEY. It even has a wiki that is somewhat needed but not necessary(meaning that u don't need it because of poor execution or badly made features) which for a game this old is rare. I couldn't recommend it more 11\\10.",
